  "_comment": "SYNTHETIC. Not captured from a real Ring device: no Ring simulator is documented anywhere, and real testing needs a US-located device on a paid Ring Protection plan. These are hand-specified events written to Ring's documented webhook envelope and signed with the real HMAC-SHA256 scheme by threshold/replay.py before delivery, so the code path they exercise is the live one. Nine days across three households and four doors, 2026-09-14 to 2026-09-22. Deliberate cases: Wednesday 16 Sept the midday window has back-door activity and none at the front, which is the key-safe case the boundary note describes; Friday 18 Sept the midday window has nothing at any door; Saturday 19 Sept is silent all day at Oakfield; millbrook stops recording after 20 Sept to exercise the silence watch; harewood linked its account on 21 Sept so everything earlier is not comparable.",
